d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9b1d4045e25e08f34cb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.527,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76279","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["顾客您好，本店不销售酒类，非常抱歉。","请给我一瓶烧酒。","做胎教的话，什么比较好呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请给我一瓶烧酒。","做胎教的话，什么比较好呢？","顾客您好，本店不销售酒类，非常抱歉。"],"answer":2}]}
